meta {
  name: Delete Style
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:dataSetId/styles/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dataSetId: {{dataSetId}}
  id: {{styleId}}
}

docs {
  **Precondition:** `dataSetId` and `styleId` are set. The Style must not be referenced by any Layer (delete dependent Layers or detach their style references first).

  **Expected Response:** 204 No Content.

  **Verification:** Issue `get-style-by-id` for the same `styleId` and confirm 404.

  **System Impact:**

  | Layer | Effect |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | Style record removed |
  | Config Adapter | — |
  | External System | — |
}
